============================================================================
Priority actions checklist
After completing all analyses, execute actions in order:
1. Terminate blocking sessions (if any)
2. Run VACUUM ANALYZE on tables with high bloat
3. Remove unused indexes
4. Add missing indexes for frequently executed queries
5. Increase work_mem for queries using many temp files
6. Adjust checkpoint_completion_target if checkpoints_req > 20%
7. Analyze and optimize top 10 slow queries
============================================================================

